<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '26px 64px 18px 64px', position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, height: 104 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>权限化 RAG：先过滤，再检索</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#6B7A72', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>顺序错了，后面做多少都没用</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44, height: 526 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 620, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center', padding: '14px 18px', background: 'rgba(22,119,98,0.07)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#167762', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>01</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>认出这个人是谁</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#44534C' }}>来自企业目录的身份，不是自建账号</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center', padding: '14px 18px', background: 'rgba(22,119,98,0.07)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#167762', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>02</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>把候选范围压到他有权限的部分</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#44534C' }}>按部门 / 项目 / 密级过滤，越权文档根本不进入计算</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center', padding: '14px 18px', background: 'rgba(22,119,98,0.07)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#167762', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>03</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>只在允许的范围内做相似度检索</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#44534C' }}>Top-K 从过滤后的集合里取，不是取完再筛</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center', padding: '14px 18px', background: '#167762', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.75)', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>04</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>生成答案，引用同样过滤</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.82)' }}>答案里的出处，只能是他能打开的那几份</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7A72', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>每一步都是硬约束，不是提示词里"请不要泄露"。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C2410C' }}>"检索完再删结果"为什么不行</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#44534C', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>模型已经读到了那段内容，答案里可能已经把它复述出来。删结果只能骗过眼睛，骗不过已经生成的文字。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 100, height: 1, background: 'rgba(15,30,25,0.12)' }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>引用本身就是信息</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#44534C', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>文件名、章节名、标题常常比正文更敏感。所以引用列表也要走同一套权限判断。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 100, height: 1, background: 'rgba(15,30,25,0.12)' }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1E19' }}>会说"没有"，才算可用</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#44534C', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>资料里没有就直说没有，不靠猜补齐。演示里问一个知识库外的问题，它会明确拒答。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 64, right: 64, bottom: 12, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7A72' }}>SENTINEL · 安全开发环境方案</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7A72', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>10 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
